B.be1=new A.nQ("The great levy","Every Mercian province musters 30% more levies.")
B.be2=new A.nQ("Mountain fastness","Your hosts and levies fight 15% harder defending anywhere, and 30% harder on Welsh land.")
B.be3=new A.nQ("Sea kings","Longships cost a third less than other realms' ships and are built on any coast you hold, where your hosts also recruit.")
